<title>CHILE: Chilean Sept fishmeal exports fall to $36 mln.</title>
<headline>Chilean Sept fishmeal exports fall to $36 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean fishmeal exports fell sharply to $36 million in September from $66.6 million in the same month last year and $58.4 million in August 1996, said the central bank.</p>
<p>Fishmeal exports totaled $129 million in the first nine months of the year compared with $143.2 million in the same period 1995, said the bank.</p>
<p>--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
